  "Starting cards as marked '(start)': Endor, Endor: Rebel Landing Site (Forest), Your Insight Serves You Well, Strike Planning and Insurrection, with the Objective; several Effects start, so starting.effect is left empty. Total 60 as published.",
  "Byline 'Phillip Aasen' credited to the existing page [[Phil Aasen]] (Phillip Aasen redirects there).",
  "Posted 'YIWYW' dested Your Insight Serves You Well (the strategy calls it 'YISYW'/'Insight'); 'CoK' dested Chewbacca Of Kashyyyk (the strategy uses him to get out Wuta); 'EPP Luke' Luke With Lightsaber; 'EPP Obi' Obi-Wan With Lightsaber; 'EPP Leia' Leia With Blaster Rifle; 'DoS' Daughter Of Skywalker; 'WA, RSL' Wedge Antilles, Red Squadron Leader; 'Ani's Stick' Anakin's Lightsaber.",
  "Posted 'Landing Platform', 'Back Door', 'Hidden Forest Trail', 'Chief Chirpa's Hut' and 'Rebel Landing Site' dested the Endor sites; 'Nein Nunb' Nien Nunb; 'Figran D'an' Figrin D'an; 'Seargent Brooks Carlson' Sergeant Brooks Carlson; Weapon Levitation is the Light Jabba's Palace interrupt.",
  "The post credits the deck idea to Brian Hunter and Steven Lewis."
